                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- This WARLORD is eligible to perform a Heroic Intervention if it is within 6&quot; horizontally and 5&quot; vertically of any enemy units. Each time this WARLORD makes a Heroic Intervention move, it can move up to 6&quot;. All other rules for Heroic Interventions still apply.
