              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a model in this unit would lose a wound as a result of a mortal wound, roll one D6: on a 4+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
